<title>SPAIN: Spain 18-month bill yield starts at 5.352%.</title>
<headline>Spain 18-month bill yield starts at 5.352%.</headline>
<dateline>MADRID 1997-04-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Spain announced the following results at Monday's Treasury debt auction (amounts bid, allocated in billions of pesetas):</p>
<p>ISSUE     Yield   Pvs   Price   Pvs     Bid	Allocated</p>
<p> 1-year     5.300  5.347  94.90 94.87	310.23     165.01</p>
<p>18-months   5.352  n.a    92.37   n.a	418.17     374.62</p>
<p>NOTE - The Spanish Treasury started today a regular program of 18-month bills auctions.</p>
<p>-- Madrid Newsroom, + 341 585 8340</p>
</text>
